OL,3,GNEWSAFormer theatre staff reported to
OL,4,Apolice for theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer staff working for a theatre
OL,7,Fcompany have been reported to the
OL,8,Fpolice for theft following an
OL,9,Finvestigation into misconduct.
OL,11,FThe BBC understands the allegations
OL,12,Frelate to a number of staff formerly
OL,13,Fworking at Norwich Theatre's Playhouse
OL,14,Fbar, who have now been dismissed.
OL,16,FA smaller number of the ex-employees
OL,17,Fhave also been accused of creating
OL,18,F"inappropriate graffiti", the theatre
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
