OL,3,GNEWSAFormer theatre staff reported to
OL,4,Apolice for theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson added it has been
OL,7,F"forced" to make the allegations public
OL,8,Fafter the union Unite announced staff
OL,9,Fwere joining as members following
OL,10,F"serious concerns about a series of
OL,11,Fdismissals". The union said its members
OL,12,Fdeny the allegations.
